      "statement": "The LLM completion wrapper is decorated with a retry policy that retries only the exception classes in LLM_RETRY_EXCEPTIONS (connection errors, rate limits, service unavailability, timeouts, internal server errors, and empty responses); authentication and bad-request errors fail on the first attempt.",
